      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Cloud Provider**\n\nI've decided to go with Google Cloud Pub/Sub for publishing the JSON event. The next step is to make sure this selection is explicit and easily identifiable within the `publish_event.py` script.\n\n\n**Defining the Pub/Sub Integration**\n\nI'm now fully committed to Google Cloud Pub/Sub and will integrate it via the `publish_event.py` script. The implementation details are being nailed down. I plan to use the `google.cloud.pubsub_v1` library, which will be explicit. The code will publish a JSON event to a topic specified by its project and topic IDs. Next, I'll need to define how to handle potential errors during publication.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861761587,
          "start": 1789861759336
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1309680017vSwcyfsubh9K1",
